{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"4f0b69a94b978fab98de3df614bce93105e13291e015b57fe455875409ce220a","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"ef21328527959af7aac60fe977435f9d0158eb8dd4e3804296a24763f5acb297","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ef3dcead3d0d1a7363776dcee8a52c7e56ed58f92ed671d65c31c97da01f59e0","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ef608e1de8bba12f2e236f598c5869d3946e92ee5ebf7e0855e81acb2538c1a6","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ef7d5a43a10dc8eae43e1f4e8f15d7ca626123291c6d722daf5395cf2080324e","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"jewelry-store.lua:169 源文为冬潮之月的一部分因离太阳过近而融化（melted）并从天空坠落；译文漏译「融化」，改写为「掉落了下来并融入了大地，使那个地方充满能量」，增添了「融入大地」这一源文没有的因果。另外第168行 potent amulets 只表示「强力的」，没有比较义，译文「更强大的项链」凭空多了比较。"},{"revision_key":"ef88e6a80185db3dbd603f80b5fcd33bf1f70360777c5a989fa8bc9ca1c88ec7","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ef9f97a2e35279283eb9a65b619c956c309c9fdce53a4f3b656da98956a54c4d","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"psi-archery.lua:50 源文 with precise telekinetic nudges 说明箭矢是靠念力微调来导引的，这是灵能弓术（psionic/psi-archery）的机制核心；译文「射出一支导引箭精确的飞向敌人」删掉了念力导引，把施放方式改写成箭本身带有导引，同时「精确的」应作「精确地」。数值部分与第42行 atk/crit_chance=inc 一致。"},{"revision_key":"efe21d07a2bbc4c69fbb66e67a4ca2343455241783abe030016d3abfc2348cfd","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"canine.lua:62 中 snaps at you 指朝你猛咬、龇牙扑咬，译文「咆哮」是吼叫，意思不符；prowls 也不是「在你面前」徘徊，而是潜行、逡巡，属于语义偏差。"}]}